Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.00,0:13:15.79,Alternative,,0,0,0,,You're late!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.04,0:15:40.31,Alternative,,0,0,0,,S-Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.66,0:15:55.33,Alternative,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.81,0:01:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Space-time fluctuation has increased from zel 050 to zel 070.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.85,0:01:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No change to estimated arrival time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.71,0:02:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,7th Squadron will proceed to dock 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.71,0:03:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,6th and 13th Destroyer Groups will enter at dock 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.55,0:03:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Port crew, begin anchoring ships.\NMechanics, stand by for further orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.74,0:03:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Here are Lord Desler's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.22,0:03:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Effective tam 12:08, Domel, Commander of the Small Magellanic Cloud Defense Forces,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.55,0:03:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,is appointed Milky Way Theatre Operations Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.77,0:03:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,His predecessor, Goer, will serve as his second-in-command.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.83,0:03:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.76,0:03:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, a message from Flaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.09,0:03:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,"The Wolf has danced with the Sheep."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.35,0:03:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Has something happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.60,0:03:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The hound seems to have found its prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.30,0:04:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Two enemy spatial torpedoes have crashed into the planetesimal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.22,0:04:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Distance 3,000 km.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.98,0:04:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Another attempt to find us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.89,0:04:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as we hide within this protostar's interstellar medium,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.98,0:04:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,finding the Yamato will be very difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.61,0:04:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Your decision was excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.74,0:04:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But where did they come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.78,0:04:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything on radar?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.70,0:04:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I couldn't locate them last time, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.16,0:04:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So they're stealthed?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.91,0:04:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been here four hours. We can't stay forever...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.38,0:04:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Another incoming.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.38,0:05:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hit! At ten o'clock, distance 200.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.02,0:05:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Close hyperspace vents. Adjust course from 22 to 30.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.32,0:05:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Dimensional pressure normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.36,0:05:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Phase displacement parameters normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.24,0:05:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Unable to detect Dimensional Wave Motion pattern.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.07,0:05:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,They aren't taking the bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.45,0:05:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,With this much interstellar medium, we can't track their spatial wake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.46,0:05:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Intelligent little rats.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.71,0:05:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The smarter the prey, the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.73,0:05:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Heini, we shall enjoy ourselves during this war.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.18,0:05:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Small dimensional quakes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.93,0:05:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, this is just a guess,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.98,0:06:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,but the enemy may be using a ship able to create a corridor into a dimensional rift.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.07,0:06:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.18,0:06:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.29,0:06:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.38,0:06:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to operate. Get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.92,0:06:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.30,0:06:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,As XO, I will take command until\NCaptain Okita is fit to return to duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.35,0:06:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We will assume that the enemy ship is capable of interdimensional flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.31,0:06:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Niimi and Mori, try to track the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.90,0:06:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.53,0:06:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,A ship that can travel to other dimensions...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.37,0:06:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Dimensional Submarine UX01 is\Nunder His Lordship's direct control.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.79,0:07:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm amazed that his office permitted you to bring it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.92,0:07:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.80,0:07:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.22,0:07:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.64,0:07:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The hound's owner is Admiral Ditz.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.60,0:07:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, if old man Ditz agrees, there's no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.10,0:07:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The problem will be Captain Flaken...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.29,0:07:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.86,0:07:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not an easy man to command.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.65,0:07:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,My motto is adaptability above all else.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.49,0:07:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep that in mind, Goer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.03,0:07:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Z-Zar Balk...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.42,0:07:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Blood pressure is 120 over 75. Pulse is 60.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.84,0:07:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, I'll save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.05,0:07:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Begin the operation!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.18,0:07:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Activating medical drone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.43,0:07:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Medical nanomachines on standby.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.78,0:08:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.66,0:08:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.33,0:08:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Our prey is smart. And frightened.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.25,0:08:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They're waiting for us to make the first move.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.47,0:08:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How long are we staying here? Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.03,0:08:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The officers know what they're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.77,0:08:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But the Captain collapsed, right? He won't die, will he?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.44,0:08:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yabu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.11,0:08:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss! When did you get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.24,0:08:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Yabu. He won't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.20,0:09:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That will not happen. Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.04,0:09:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.84,0:09:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.01,0:09:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Any movement?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.68,0:09:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if they can submerge dimensionally, their ability to stay must have a limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.89,0:09:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll show themselves eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.64,0:09:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So we keep waiting, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.15,0:09:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too tense.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.74,0:09:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's difficult to wait, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.07,0:09:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.29,0:09:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been waiting a long time with no luck. Maybe they're already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.83,0:09:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.17,0:09:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting tired of hide and seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.09,0:09:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's give something a try...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.63,0:09:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Another 400cc's of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.60,0:10:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The operation is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.64,0:10:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,XO, if you know anything, please tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.77,0:10:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.31,0:10:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with the Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.82,0:10:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ship on radar. Four o'clock, distance 28,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.82,0:10:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Wavelength is specific to Garmillas ships. That must be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.70,0:10:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy is leaving the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.00,0:10:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.14,0:10:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,They gave up and left.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.21,0:10:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's too soon to assume they're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.71,0:10:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any evidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.26,0:10:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I do not. If I had to say, call it intuition.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.30,0:10:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It runs in the family, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.22,0:10:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.23,0:10:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,XO, why don't we use the warp engine's subsystems as a hyperspace transducer?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.94,0:10:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If we use the dimensional fault data to set the parameters,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.24,0:11:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,we should be able to fire a sonar ping\Nacross the dimensional boundary layer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.41,0:11:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dimensional active sonar, huh? That would\Nshow if they're hiding in another dimension.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.12,0:11:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But it would also reveal our position.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.38,0:11:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't let fear paralyze you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.22,0:11:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I suggest using the Seagull to patrol for hostiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.26,0:11:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The new hyperspace sonar buoy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.72,0:11:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it works using the same principle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.85,0:11:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we should be able to find any hidden enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.48,0:11:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Theoretically.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.27,0:11:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But sending the Seagull out in all this space dust is suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.96,0:11:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But if the enemy is still there, we could search without revealing our position.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.91,0:11:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And who will you order to undertake this dangerous mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.16,0:11:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.58,0:11:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.45,0:11:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,XO?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.50,0:11:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This is only for confirmation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.71,0:11:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Niimi's plan is more realistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.96,0:11:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.80,0:12:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No. Niimi, prepare the pinger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.72,0:12:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.51,0:12:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,CIC, this is Sado.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.18,0:12:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The Captain's operation is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.01,0:12:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a success.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.19,0:12:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,XO Sanada, why don't you send\Nsomeone to check on the Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.24,0:12:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave the bridge to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.96,0:12:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You need the courage to disobey an order you believe is wrong, to remain true to yourself.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.39,0:12:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That is what I think.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.35,0:12:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You came to see him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.15,0:12:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Take good care of the Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.49,0:13:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do anything stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.79,0:13:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Inputting Wave Motion parameters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.70,0:13:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.79,0:13:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Kitano entering.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.50,0:13:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready, AU09?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.79,0:13:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.17,0:13:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.42,0:13:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare for sonar ping.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.46,0:13:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyperspace transducer standing by.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.34,0:13:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The hyperspace sonar buoy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.43,0:13:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. As soon as it's loaded, I'll go out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.52,0:13:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's already loaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.06,0:13:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,They say to stay one step ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.69,0:13:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Enomoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.94,0:13:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You remember that from training, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.15,0:13:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, get going... We're launching the Seagull.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.86,0:13:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But the order...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.32,0:13:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,...hasn't been issued.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.91,0:13:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already taken care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.50,0:13:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And you two will accompany me in the Seagull, to assist the Tactical Officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.29,0:14:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Firing dimensional sonar pinger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.46,0:14:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to track the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.30,0:14:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire the sonar pinger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.88,0:14:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Firing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.72,0:14:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is! They fell for the decoy...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.23,0:14:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't know we were here, the fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.65,0:14:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You traced that pinger, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.36,0:14:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.61,0:14:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we do it? We're doing it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.41,0:14:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Rise to dimensional periscope depth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.03,0:14:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Blow dimensional tanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.91,0:14:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the hunt begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.26,0:14:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Dimensional sonar pinger detecting a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.05,0:14:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Something rising to the dimensional boundary layer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.97,0:14:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They're tracing our pinger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.60,0:14:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Start the engine! We're getting out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.52,0:15:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise anchor!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.12,0:15:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I found you...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.79,0:15:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare the torpedoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.12,0:15:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Open torpedo tubes 1 and 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.72,0:15:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,XO, hangar on port side is opening!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.26,0:15:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.64,0:15:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Seagull, no launch order has been issued.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.77,0:15:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's on board?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.31,0:15:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Seagull launching.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.15,0:15:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, are we disobeying orders?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.70,0:15:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit whining, and get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.66,0:15:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.70,0:16:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Torpedo parameters are set.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.83,0:16:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire torpedo tubes 1 and 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.75,0:16:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Firing tubes 1 and 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.10,0:16:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Seagull, come in. Who's on board? Seagull!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.44,0:16:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Something is approaching the Yamato at high speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.69,0:16:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,These are torpedoes! Two of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.78,0:16:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.78,0:16:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Shima!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.70,0:16:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Evading.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.25,0:16:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Second torpedo approaching!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.26,0:16:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You've gotten better.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.93,0:17:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a good teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.97,0:17:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.02,0:17:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where's the Yamato?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.65,0:17:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,External armor has been penetrated. Air leakage. Rapid pressure loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.11,0:17:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Engine output dropping.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.07,0:17:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Seal deck 10!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.74,0:17:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That sonar ping came back to bite us, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.45,0:17:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Damage control.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.87,0:17:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is the Seagull. Seagull to Yamato.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.41,0:17:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.54,0:17:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Dropping hyperspace sonar buoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.04,0:17:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So it was you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.21,0:17:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.25,0:17:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Scary...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.55,0:17:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Dropping now... Iwata! Toyama!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.84,0:17:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye aye, sir...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.89,0:17:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Dropping buoys!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.61,0:17:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Our prey is tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.49,0:17:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Tubes 3 and 4... Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.45,0:18:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamato, do you read? This is the Seagull.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.37,0:18:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll send estimated appearance points for the torpedoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.58,0:18:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Use the data to shoot them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.21,0:18:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.05,0:18:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Weapons Officer, prepare to intercept torpedoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.67,0:18:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood. Prepare to intercept torpedoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.09,0:18:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to intercept torpedoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.56,0:18:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we found them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.65,0:18:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Two torpedoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.82,0:18:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Transmit data to the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.11,0:18:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.16,0:18:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Coordinates entered.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.20,0:18:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Intercept those torpedoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.45,0:18:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Open fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.77,0:19:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They anticipated our firing angle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.56,0:19:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.86,0:19:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.36,0:19:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't quit, do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.45,0:19:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They can see us, but we're at the bottom of another dimension. They can't touch us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.87,0:19:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.71,0:19:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.04,0:19:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.75,0:19:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's emerging from the dimensional boundary layer!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.92,0:19:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.88,0:19:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Nearby!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.76,0:19:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Confirming... Take us there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.05,0:19:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.89,0:19:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.02,0:19:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Seagull.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.44,0:19:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We're seeing an apparent enemy probe at four o'clock, behind the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.07,0:20:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sending coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.99,0:20:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Knock it out, and we'll blind them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.74,0:20:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He's every bit as reckless, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.87,0:20:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.71,0:20:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Inputting coordinates!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.50,0:20:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Target is in our sights. Open fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.43,0:20:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,They got us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.89,0:20:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Commencing approach. Pre-landing check.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.60,0:20:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Preparing to dock.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.52,0:20:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as the Seagull docks, we leave at top speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.65,0:20:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we're out of the system, we'll use warp to lose them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.96,0:21:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing on radar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.47,0:21:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The bastards jumped. What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.47,0:21:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, we'll allow them to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.72,0:21:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You're sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.77,0:21:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A good hound never chases too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.57,0:21:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.66,0:21:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Kodai?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.16,0:21:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And Tokugawa, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.66,0:21:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the Yamato all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.33,0:21:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow, we made it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.00,0:21:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the young ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.34,0:21:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Though it seems you went a bit too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.84,0:21:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But Sanada has arranged it so that you won't be disciplined.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.39,0:21:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't tell from his face, but he isn't a bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.35,0:21:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.35,0:21:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't want to let him die, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.98,0:22:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you didn't agree to his plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.69,0:22:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But he believed he was doing the right thing, and he acted anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.16,0:22:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think he would've done?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.24,0:22:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably the same thing as Kodai...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.34,0:22:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.87,0:25:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,A siren's song lures ships to their doom.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.54,0:25:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Snow falls in the emptiness of the void, where a shadow of evil prowls.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.21,0:25:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato is shipwrecked.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.21,0:25:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And inside, no one is to be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.63,0:25:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What will Kodai and the others see there?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.97,0:25:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time: The Whisper of the Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.14,0:25:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,There are 310 days left before humanity is extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.02,0:01:35.49,Fade sign,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\pos(960,1035)\fad(500,500)}Planet Balun
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.16,0:02:19.66,Fade sign,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\pos(960,1035)\fad(450,500)}Balun Guard Force HQ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.28,0:22:29.49,EP TS,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\blur7.5\3aH&90&\4aH&99&\pos(147.5,840)}{\fade(1000,2000)}Episode 13
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.28,0:22:29.49,EP TS,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\blur7.5\3aH&90&\4aH&99&\pos(147.5,1073)}{\fade(1000,2000)}The Wolf from Another Dimension
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.54,0:00:22.50,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Farewell, Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:26.13,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}The ship that is departing is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.13,0:00:30.30,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}The Space Battleship
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:35.39,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,2000)\blur7\be2}Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.77,0:00:39.52,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\pos(777,60)\be2}It departs now to Iscandar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.52,0:00:44.36,OP,,900,0,0,,{\an9\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}at the end of the cosmos,\Nbearing its fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:51.91,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}"We will come back, no matter what it takes"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.91,0:01:00.71,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Answer with a smile to the waving people
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.50,0:01:05.21,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Going far from the Galaxy towards Iscandar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.21,0:01:08.63,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}A faint gleam of hope
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.63,0:01:16.18,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,3000)\blur7\be2}The Space Battleship Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.70,0:22:37.50,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Believe that
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.05,0:22:45.80,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Only the future
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.97,0:22:53.64,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Has the answer
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.64,0:22:59.32,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}No one knows
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.32,0:23:14.66,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Memory only strikes at
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.67,0:23:25.84,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}The heart to find
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.84,0:23:29.93,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}The truth
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.93,0:23:37.02,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,800)}Do not forget it…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.02,0:23:45.20,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}Many stars lie beyond
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.20,0:23:53.87,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,200)}The spiral of memory
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.87,0:24:06.47,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Sparkling in what looks like
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.47,0:24:13.97,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,2000)}The light of memory
